    text: "Montasim built VidQuery - YouTube Q&A Extension, an extension project. A Chromium extension that answers questions about a YouTube video with Gemini, using its visible metadata, transcript and the viewer's own API key. His role covered product designer and browser-extension engineer, with scope spanning browser integration, provider workflow, privacy, and release delivery. Users can ask questions about an open YouTube video. A hiring manager, developer, or client can use the linked case study to review the constraints, architecture, Montasim's contribution, and the result—not just the project summary."
