    question: Where can I download Air Traffic Control?
    text: "Android users can install it from Google Play: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=dev.montasim.airtrafficcontrol. Windows users can install it from the Microsoft Store: https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9N5536ZQ2XZM. Linux users can install it from the Snap Store: https://snapcraft.io/air-traffic-control. Developers and clients can use the project page to review the current public product site, packaged releases, and the product capabilities behind those downloads."
