    question: What is Montasim's Survey Module Backend project?
    text: "Montasim built Survey Module Backend, an API project. This client work was part of his Freelance Developer engagement with TalendIT. An Express and Mongoose API prototype for school-dropout research, separating surveys, templates, and completed survey records alongside user, role, permission, and authentication modules. His role covered survey-domain modeling and backend API development, with scope spanning survey resource models, database services, versioned routes, and shared request infrastructure. The inspected source contains concrete survey persistence operations and separate models for survey setup and completed records. A hiring manager, developer, or client can use the linked case study to review the constraints, architecture, Montasim's contribution, and the result—not just the project summary."
