  - id: "case-study:update-skillfolio-catalog:problem"
    category: case-study
    question: What problem did Montasim address in the update-skillfolio-catalog case study?
    text: "Adding a skill to a catalog touches several consumers that duplicate its data, such as README indexes and the sitemap. It can also import stale package or repository facts, or treat a request to \"publish\" as permission to deploy. Either mistake breaks the catalog or makes an external change nobody approved. Montasim owned agent workflow design and automation engineering, covering agent workflow, validation automation, and packaging. The solution also had to respect “Catalog schemas and the consumers that read them vary between target apps”; “Repository, package, version, and compatibility facts must be verified against primary sources”. This case is useful to hiring teams and clients because it shows how he discovers the technical and product constraints behind an apparently simple request."
