  - id: "case-study:update-skillfolio-catalog:architecture"
    category: case-study
    question: How did Montasim structure the update-skillfolio-catalog solution?
    text: "The skill resolves the skill's identity from public package and repository evidence, then traces the target app's schema and every consumer of the catalog. A Python entry validator and the repository's own format, type, test, build, and sitemap checks decide whether the change is complete. A representative decision was “Discover the live catalog schema”: Schemas differ between target apps, so an assumed shape could produce entries that look valid but do not render. Reading the current schema costs a step on every run. The value of this architecture is the reasoning behind it—Montasim connects a real constraint to an explicit boundary that another developer can review, test, and evolve."
