    question: What problem did Montasim address in the CLM API case study?
    text: "Support teams need to receive and respond to conversations across WhatsApp, Messenger, and Instagram, route them to suitable agents, and preserve conversation state across asynchronous events and service restarts. Montasim owned freelance developer, covering messaging services and integrations, persistence, real-time conversation events, and automated tests. The solution also had to respect “Work took place in an existing multi-tenant backend; the full platform is shared team work, not an individual implementation”; “External messaging providers have distinct event formats, registration flows, media lifetimes, and channel restrictions”. This case is useful to hiring teams and clients because it shows how he discovers the technical and product constraints behind an apparently simple request."
