    question: What did Montasim deliver and achieve with mime-types-lite?
    text: "Montasim implemented extension-to-type and type-to-extension lookups. He added normalization and validation helpers. He configured typed ESM and CommonJS publishing. He built interactive docs, examples, tests, CI, and Netlify deployment. The resulting capabilities and outcomes are “Consumers can infer common media types from filenames”; “Consumers can recover the preferred extension for a media type”; “Media-type inputs can be validated and normalized before use”; “The same API works in browser and Node.js module systems”. This gives a reviewer a traceable line from Montasim's implementation work to the product capabilities and limits that followed."
