    category: experience
    question: What did Montasim do as Freelance Developer at Infomax?
    text: "As Freelance Developer at Infomax (Mar 2024 - Mar 2024), Montasim organized questions, exams, courses, enrolment, and results into versioned Express modules for an MCQ learning platform. He centralized controller wrappers, response formatting, and error handling to give new features a consistent API structure. He added Helmet security headers, request limits, timeouts, and rate limiting at the application boundary. He included Nodemailer error notifications and Docker/PM2 deployment configuration. He the reviewed implementation establishes API infrastructure; persisted learning workflows, exam execution, and result storage remain incomplete. Related projects include MCQ Topper Backend. For a hiring manager, this is role-specific evidence of what he owned, delivered, or improved at that stage of his career—not a title-only claim."
