    category: experience
    question: What did Montasim do as Freelance Developer at TalendIT?
    text: "As Freelance Developer at TalendIT (Oct 2023 - Nov 2023), Montasim built Next.js and React school pages for admissions, notices, routines, results, staff, and galleries, with responsive navigation, Swiper galleries, and a Google Maps integration. He the frontend uses local sample content and an in-memory admin demonstration. He in the school backend, implemented Google Drive file handling and stored admission-document identifiers and links in MongoDB. He separated controllers, persistence services, and Joi input validation. He built Mongoose survey CRUD services, keeping survey definitions, reusable templates, and completed school/location records separate. He co-developed TechnoFire's PHP, MySQLi, and MariaDB catalog and administration codebase with Abid Hasan Piash; individual ownership of its features is not established. He these repositories document prototypes and implementation scope, not verified production deployment. Related projects include School Management Backend, School Management, Survey Module Backend, TechnoFire. For a hiring manager, this is role-specific evidence of what he owned, delivered, or improved at that stage of his career—not a title-only claim."
