    supportingExcerpts[5]: "employment\nMyMedicalHub International Ltd.\nhttps://mymedicalhub.com\nLead a team of **3 engineers** and own frontend architecture across **3 microservices** of a HIPAA-compliant telemedicine and biometric-assessment platform used by **1,000+ patients and clinicians**. Replaced fragile React-hook state with a deterministic **finite-state-machine** engine, so **99.9%** of assessment sessions complete without a crash or freeze, with **60 FPS** MediaPipe pose estimation and real-time rep counting. Built a **Konva.js**","employment\nMyMedicalHub International Ltd.\nhttps://mymedicalhub.com\nBuilt the real-time video consultation layer of a telemedicine platform for remote physical therapy. Added real-time AI analysis and joint-angle measurement to live sessions, making assessments **25% faster** than manual measurement with **95%+ accuracy** against expert clinicians. Replaced the third-party OpenTok service with a **WebRTC** pipeline on self-hosted STUN/TURN servers and Socket.IO, turning a usage-based bill (about **$3K a year**)","AI & Agent Development\nskills-ai-agents\nAgent Skills\nGemini API\nGroq API\nOpenRouter\nZhipuAI","User-controlled Chrome side-panel extension for drafting replies from pasted or selected LinkedIn posts, refining writing, and keeping every publish action manual.\n\nfalse\n2026-07-17T21:02:58Z\nb2085eead2f039535d2caf81c901d57c0028298a\n2026-07-17T20:56:56Z\nhttps://github.com/montasim/Thoughtline\nproject-thoughtline\nassets/projects/thoughtline.png\nhttps://thoughtline.netlify.app\nhttps://thoughtline.netlify.app/brand/thoughtline-mark.svg\n\nhttps://github.com/montasim/Thoughtline/releases/latest\nWXT\nReact","LinkedIn content scripts extract the visible conversation, and a bounded manual input accepts pasted posts.\nPage integration\nReact side-panel workflows cover replies, ideas, refinement, history, settings, and onboarding.\nExtension interface\nTyped drafting and source-research ports use curated free Ope