    supportingExcerpts[2]: "May 11, 2026\nSyed Mahedi Hasen\nreported to Mohammad Montasim Al Mamun directly\nSWE @MyMedicalHub | Scalable SaaS | Cybersecurity Research Enthusiast\nI had the privilege of working with Montasim Bhai while contributing to the Patient Portal at My Medical Hub. As a Junior Software Engineer, I worked on the chatbot and dashboard modules under his guidance.\n\nMontasim Bhai consistently helped me understand complex business requirements and translate them into practical technical solutions. Whenever I faced challenges","Creators and small teams repeat the same editorial work for every social platform. They rewrite one idea for different limits, compare weak AI variants, check brand language, and then move the result into separate publishing tools.\nAI providers vary in availability, rate limits, model behavior, and key quotas.\nLinkedIn, X, and Facebook each impose different OAuth, account, content, and API requirements.\nScheduled publishing must survive beyond the request that created it and retain a reviewable status."
