    supportingExcerpts[2]: "Organised campus events for students and staff as a student volunteer. Planned Iftar Mahfil gatherings during Ramadan, plus educational picnics and study tours. Led a volunteer team, managed event budgets, and worked with faculty and students to shape each event around what the community wanted.\nvolunteering-carmichael-event-organizer\nRangpur, Bangladesh\nC\n/images/organizations/carmichael-college.png\nCarmichael College, Rangpur\n\n2014 - 2016\nEvent Organizer","Organised school events that brought students and alumni together. Planned annual Iftar gatherings and class get-togethers, managed event budgets, coordinated volunteer teams, and handled last-minute issues on the day so each event ran smoothly.\nvolunteering-rangpur-zilla-school-event-organizer\nRangpur, Bangladesh\nR\n/images/organizations/rangpur-zilla-school.png\nRangpur Zilla School\n\n2011 - 2013\nEvent Organizer"
