    factIds[4]: "experience:experience-multiversal-junior-frontend-developer","experience:experience-mymedicalhub-software-engineer","experience:experience-mymedicalhub-senior-software-engineer","skills:skills-frontend"
    supportingExcerpts[4]: "employment\nMultiversal Software Ltd.\n\nFrontend intern on a telemedicine platform and my first production React work. Built **responsive React components** used across desktop and mobile, fixed front-end performance and stability issues to **reduce page load time**, and delivered features in an Agile team with sprints, code review, documentation and Git.\nexperience-multiversal-junior-frontend-developer\nUttara, Dhaka, Bangladesh\nM\n/images/organizations/multiversal.jpg\nAug 2022 - Oct 2022\nJunior Frontend","employment\nMyMedicalHub International Ltd.\nhttps://mymedicalhub.com\nOwned the biometric strength-assessment module end to end and led cloud cost and infrastructure work across **4 environments**. Cut cloud hosting cost **70%** (about **$10K a year**) by moving from self-managed VMs to **Azure App Service** with GitHub Actions CI/CD, and improved application performance **40%** to **Lighthouse 90+** by replacing 5 legacy UI libraries. Designed a **feature-flag system** and API-driven theming that serve **250+","employment\nMyMedicalHub International Ltd.\nhttps://mymedicalhub.com\nLead a team of **3 engineers** and own frontend architecture across **3 microservices** of a HIPAA-compliant telemedicine and biometric-assessment platform used by **1,000+ patients and clinicians**. Replaced fragile React-hook state with a deterministic **finite-state-machine** engine, so **99.9%** of assessment sessions complete without a crash or freeze, with **60 FPS** MediaPipe pose estimation and real-time rep counting. Built a **Konva.js**","Frontend\nskills-frontend\nReact.js\nNext.js\nTypeScript\nJavaScript\nHTML5\nCSS\nTailwind CSS\nRedux.js\nTanStack Start\nTanStack Query\nReact Three Fiber\nThree.js\nDrei\nReact Three Rapier\nshadcn/ui\nRadix UI\nReact Hook Form\nReact Markdown\nCodeMirror 6\nnext-intl\nVite\nBootstrap\njQuery\nResponsive Web Design\nKonva.js\nReact Router\nSwiper\nAxios"
