    supportingExcerpts[4]: "certifications\n24","skills\n11","1824\n53\n32\n366\n99\n2025-08-11\n2026-08-11\n2026-08-04\n364\n1824\n0\n2025-08-11\n0\n2025-08-12\n0\n2025-08-13\n0\n2025-08-14\n0\n2025-08-15\n0\n2025-08-16\n0\n2025-08-17\n0\n2025-08-18\n0\n2025-08-19\n0\n2025-08-20\n0\n2025-08-21\n0\n2025-08-22\n0\n2025-08-23\n0\n2025-08-24\n0\n2025-08-25\n0\n2025-08-26\n2\n2025-08-27\n0\n2025-08-28\n0\n2025-08-29\n0\n2025-08-30\n0\n2025-08-31\n0\n2025-09-01\n0\n2025-09-02\n0\n2025-09-03\n0\n2025-09-04\n0\n2025-09-05\n0\n2025-09-06\n0\n2025-09-07\n0\n2025-09-08\n0\n2025-09-09\n0\n2025-09-10\n0\n2025-09-11\n0\n2025-09-12\n0\n2025-09-13\n0\n2025-09-14\n0\n202","May 12, 2026\nMahmudul Ahsan\nworked with Mohammad Montasim Al Mamun on the same team\nSoftware Engineer @MyMedicalHub | ITEE-FE Certified\nI’ve had the opportunity to work under Montasim bhai as my Front-End Team Lead at MyMedicalHub International, and it has been a great learning experience for me.\n\nAs my first team lead in the software industry, he made my journey as a beginner much easier and more comfortable. He is always supportive and approachable whenever I face challenges in my tasks, which helped me grow"
  - id: "contributions-learning:activity-interpretation"
    category: contributions-learning
    question: What can a recruiter reasonably infer from Montasim's contribution graph?
    text: "A recruiter can infer sustained visible development activity during the recorded window, with 1,824 contributions across 32 active weeks. The graph cannot establish code quality, ownership, or business impact by itself, so those judgments should come from the role, project, and case-study evidence."
